# Cadence

This file (and `WARP.md`, which is a symlink to it) intentionally defers to `CLAUDE.md`.

`CLAUDE.md` at the repo root is the single source of truth for:

- workspace layout (this is a Bun monorepo: `apps/cadence`, `apps/marketing`)
- commands and scripts
- folder structure and code style
- code quality rules

Read `CLAUDE.md` first. Do not duplicate its content here, since drift between rule files is what made this stub necessary.
